          "solution": "Put $u=\\lambda x$: $\\frac1x\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du=af(x)\\Rightarrow\\int_0^xf=axf(x)$. Differentiate: $f=af+axf'\\Rightarrow\\frac{f'}f=\\frac{1-a}{a}\\cdot\\frac1x$.<br>So $f=x^k$ ($f(1)=1$), $k=\\frac{1-a}a$. $f(16)=16^k=\\frac18\\Rightarrow2^{4k}=2^{-3}\\Rightarrow k=-\\frac34$.<br>$f'(x)=-\\frac34x^{-7/4}\\Rightarrow f'\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)=-\\frac34\\cdot16^{7/4}=-\\frac34\\cdot128=-96$.<br>$16-(-96)=112$.<br><b>Answer: 112</b>"
